  data: {
    LLM: 'Game: Fan Tan (Sevens). Logic: See rules.objective and rules.gameplay.',
    Player: "Fan Tan, also widely known as 'Sevens', 'Domino', or 'Parliament', is a classic layout-based card game where the objective is to be the first to get rid of all your cards. Players build upon a central layout of cards, starting with the Sevens and expanding outward to the Ace and Two in each suit. It is a game of both luck and light strategy, as players can choose to hold back key 'blocking' cards to prevent opponents from playing.",
    objective: 'Play letter cards quickly by changing the current four-letter word into another valid word.',
    gameplay: 'Four card piles show the current word. Players play letter cards onto one pile at a time to create a new valid four-letter word, racing to use cards before opponents.',
    keyRules: [
      'Only one letter is changed with each played card.',
      'The resulting four-letter word must be valid.',
      'Cards are played as a fast word-changing race.',
    ],
    bonusRuleGuids: [],
